@startuml OAuth_Authentication_Flow
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid

title Sequence: OAuth 2.0 Authentication (Auth0 / OIDC)

actor User
participant "Browser\n(auth.js)" as UI
participant "Express Server\n(server.js)" as Server
participant "Auth0\nUniversal Login" as Auth0

User -> UI : Clicks [🔐 Log in] button
UI -> Server : GET /auth/login
note over Server
  express-openid-connect
  middleware initiates flow
end note

Server -> Auth0 : Redirect to /authorize?\nclient_id=...\n&redirect_uri=http://localhost/auth/callback\n&scope=openid profile email offline_access\n&response_type=code\n&state=...
note over Auth0 #e3f2fd
  OIDC Authorization Code Flow
end note

Auth0 -> User : Display login form
User -> Auth0 : Enter email & password
Auth0 -> Auth0 : Validate credentials
note over Auth0 #c8f0c8
  ✓ Credentials valid
  Generate authorization code
end note

Auth0 -> Server : Redirect to /auth/callback?\ncode=AUTH_CODE_XYZ\n&state=...
note over Server #e3f2fd
  OIDC middleware intercepts
end note

Server -> Server : 1. Validate state parameter\n2. Exchange code for tokens\n3. Validate id_token (JWT)\n4. Extract claims:\n   - name: "Alice"\n   - email: "alice@example.com"\n   - sub: "auth0|12345"\n5. Keep id/access/refresh tokens in session\n6. Issue encrypted HTTP-only session cookie
note over Server #c8f0c8
  ✓ Secure session established
  User data extracted from JWT
end note

Server -> UI : 302 Redirect: Location: /
UI -> Server : GET /
Server -> UI : 200 OK + index.html

UI -> Server : GET /api/auth/status
Server --> UI : { authenticated: true }

UI -> Server : GET /api/me
Server --> UI : {\n  name: "Alice",\n  email: "alice@example.com",\n  sub: "auth0|12345"\n}

UI -> UI : Update header:\nDisplay "Alice"\nShow [Log out] button
UI -> User : Restore chat history;\nre-send pendingMessage if one was saved

@enduml
